{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:12:21.434Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Get Started With Private Label Supplements | [BRAND_TBD] Private Label","id":"216194811571","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"linkRelCanonicalUrl":"","metaDescription":"Schedule a free 30-minute private label supplement consultation. Discuss your audience, goals, and the right path to launch your supplement brand.","name":"Private Label - Page - Get Started","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"en/pl-demo-get-started","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:27:56.728Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/en/pl-demo-get-started","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">GET STARTED</p>\n<h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Let's build your private label supplement line.</h1>\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Schedule a 30-minute consultation with our private label specialists.&nbsp;We will discuss your audience, your goals, and the right path to launch.</p>\n<a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a></div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157270,"order":0,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">What to expect in your consultation.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Our consultations are working sessions, not sales pitches. We will walk through your business goals, the supplement categories that make sense for your audience, pricing transparency at your projected volumes, and realistic timeline from first conversation to first shipment.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">If we are a fit, you will leave with a clear next step. If we are not, you will leave with better questions to ask other manufacturers. Either way, you will know more about private label supplements than 95% of brand founders.<br><br></p>\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.1; color: #d75f00; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #19332f; font-size: 32px;\">Build Your product line from over 250 supplements</span></h2>\n<div style=\"width: 45em; color: #231f20; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p>You'll have direct access to our&nbsp;extensive wholesale private label supplement line, featuring over 250 formulas specifically developed to support every system of the body. And with a range of innovative supplement delivery methods, your product line will be completely inclusive.<br><br></p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Discuss your business goals and target customer</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Review supplement categories that match your audience</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Walk through pricing at your projected order volumes</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Map your launch timeline and key decision points</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Answer any technical, regulatory, or operational questions</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Leave with a clear next step (whether we work together or not)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157271,"order":1,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background-color: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 24px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.1; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #76bc43; font-size: 32px;\">READY TO GET STARTED?</span></h2>\n<p>Let’s launch your supplement business! Fill out and submit the form below, and the DaVinci team will connect with you with the next steps for getting your new business up and running quickly.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #012638; opacity: 0.85; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #19332f;\">Tell us a bit about your brand and we will be in touch within one business day.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157272,"order":2,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"form":{"form_id":"d8dfdd90-98f1-4cba-bedf-181dd9286ca1","form_type":"HUBSPOT","message":"Thanks for submitting the form.","redirect_url":"http://www.google.com","response_type":"redirect"},"title":"Schedule Your Private Label Consultation Here"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":1784895951795,"module_id":1155238,"order":3,"styles":{},"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">ALSO USEFUL</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Before our call, you might want to read.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157274,"order":4,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px;\"><path d=\"M12 6.04A8.97 8.97 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.05 0-2.06.18-3 .51v14.25A8.99 8.99 0 0 1 6 18c2.3 0 4.4.87 6 2.29m0-14.25a8.97 8.97 0 0 1 6-2.29c1.05 0 2.06.18 3 .51v14.25A8.99 8.99 0 0 0 18 18a8.97 8.97 0 0 0-6 2.29m0-14.25v14.25\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px;\"><a href=\"https://info.davincilabs.com/private-label-supplements-guide\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\">The Definitive Guide to Private Label Supplements</a></h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">50+ pages on how private label supplements actually work. Many of the questions our consultations cover are answered here in advance.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px;\"><a href=\"https://info.davincilabs.com/ingredients-testing-certification-guide\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\">Ingredients &amp; Testing Guide</a></h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Quality is what differentiates private label brands. Read up on how we source, test, and certify.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157275,"order":5,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"> <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157276,"order":6,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218949791040,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":7,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}